y unarmed human beings does this cop have to kill to get a promotion that puts him out of patrol and not around the citizens so no more unarmed people are shot and killed by him. What is that number 3? Maybe 6? or how about 12 an even dozen unarmed people that he guns down. What is the magic number where the people who run the show removed him so the citizens are safe from him? Is there a number of unarmed people that are guned down by these kinds of cops to get them off the streets or is it a case by case basis? Is there such a number before the light goes on? </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/320927661086368956/comments/default/2669509038491029906'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/320927661086368956/comments/default/2669509038491029906'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/01/when-fugitive-dies-blue-privilege-makes.html?showComment=1484600720451#c2669509038491029906' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/01/when-fugitive-dies-blue-privilege-makes.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-320927661086368956' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/320927661086368956' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1880356405"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 16, 2017 at 2:05 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4812823163198933466</id><published>2017-01-15T13:37:50.290-07:00</published><updated>2017-01-15T13:37:50.290-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Will,&#xa;&#xa;If your column proves anything, it proves t...</title><content type='html'>Will,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;If your column proves anything, it proves that the Utah media is just as corrupt as the national media.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I live in Utah and had never heard the information regarding Best and her husband&amp;#39;s collusion in trying to steal the SUV.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;All I ever recall hearing was how evil the tow truck driver was for doing what he did.  (I will admit that I questioned this view from the beginning as I understood Best to be a car thief).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Always appreciate your excellent insight to issues that are never as simple as they seem.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/320927661086368956/comments/default/4812823163198933466'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/320927661086368956/comments/default/4812823163198933466'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/01/when-fugitive-dies-blue-privilege-makes.html?showComment=1484512670290#c4812823163198933466' title=''/><author><name>Michael</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15622350027166654627</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='24' src='//2.bp.blogspot.com/_g15TGAimJ9s/SfvV8ndmauI/AAAAAAAAAAM/m8vqqrppNfI/S220/J.Olson.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/01/when-fugitive-dies-blue-privilege-makes.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-320927661086368956' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/320927661086368956' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-53664966"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 15, 2017 at 1:37 PM"/></entry></feed>